      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_reparse_offset_must_not_pass_psblob_end",
      "fine_trace_step": 7,
      "description": "Root cause. The loop recomputes the remaining Photoshop-buffer length with unsigned `sizePsData - pos` without first enforcing `pos <= sizePsData`; once attacker-controlled IRB lengths push `pos` past the end of `psBlob`, the subtraction wraps and reparsing continues from an out-of-bounds pointer."
    },
